        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Created `.github/workflows/artifact-pipeline.yml`.\n\nThe pattern that makes it work:\n- The `deploy` job declares `needs: build`, so it waits for the uploader to finish.\n- `build` uploads with `actions/upload-artifact@v4` under name `build-output`.\n- `deploy` downloads it with `actions/download-artifact@v4` using the matching `name` (v4 isolates artifacts per job/run, so the name must match).\n\nArtifacts are scoped to the run, so the jobs must be in the same workflow run (as here).",
